  "body": "Vendor meeting the market- Must Be SOLD! All Genuine Offers Welcome\r\n\r\nTucked away in the most private position of this boutique development, this near-new freestanding home offers an exceptional blend of comfort, security, and convenience in the heart of Milford. Complete with an electric gate and additional off-street parking, 33E Stanley Avenue delivers easy modern living with that extra touch of exclusivity.\r\n\r\nDesigned for effortless family living, the light-filled interiors feature a spacious open-plan layout, complemented by a stylish contemporary kitchen with quality appliances and seamless flow to a sunny private deck - perfect for entertaining or relaxing with family and friends.\r\n\r\nThis impressive home features:\r\n\r\n* 4 generous bedrooms, including a master with ensuite\r\n* 2 modern bathrooms plus a separate guest toilet\r\n* Spacious open-plan living and dining area\r\n* Excellent indoor-outdoor flow to a private entertaining deck\r\n* Internal access carpeted garage plus extra off-street parking\r\n* Secure electric gate and private rear position\r\n\r\nZoned for some of the North Shore's most sought-after schools, including Milford Primary, Campbells Bay Primary, Takapuna Intermediate, Carmel College, and both Westlake Boys' and Girls' High Schools.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the convenience of being just moments from Milford Shopping Centre, cafés, public transport, motorway access, and the beautiful Milford Beach.\r\n\r\nWith the balance of a Master Build Guarantee still in place, this is a fantastic opportunity for families, professionals, investors, or downsizers seeking a low-maintenance lifestyle in a premium Milford location.",
